        "description": "Track 01 from \"TILT Brass - Bowery Poetry Club, August '03\", TILT Brass' second Non-Site Records \"SoundCloud Releases (SCR)\" series release. 30 seconds before walking onstage, TILT then Co-Director Chris McIntyre said \"improvise a fanfare!\" and this stunning, pithy, and humorous exclamation ensued. \"Sak Passé?\" is Haitian Creole slang for \"what's up?\"\r\n\r\nDave Ballou, Russ Johnson, Jon Nelson - trumpet \r\nGreg Evans, Tom Varner – French horn \r\nCurtis Hasselbring, Christopher McIntyre – trombone \r\nJulie Kalu – bass trombone  \r\nDave Hofstra – tuba  \r\nKevin Norton – percussion",
